stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> OPEN: posted<br/>(credits reserved)
  OPEN --> ACCEPTED: accepted
  ACCEPTED --> OPEN: courier<br/>cancels
  ACCEPTED --> IN_PROGRESS: started
  IN_PROGRESS --> PICKED_UP: picked up
  PICKED_UP --> DELIVERED: delivered
  DELIVERED --> COMPLETED: confirmed or 48 h<br/>(courier paid)
  OPEN --> EXPIRED: expiry<br/>(refund)
  OPEN --> CANCELLED: cancelled<br/>(refund)
  EXPIRED --> [*]: repost as a new<br/>OPEN order (NTH4)
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]

  classDef open fill:#E8F0FE,stroke:#1A73E8,stroke-width:2px,color:#202124
  classDef active fill:#FEF7E0,stroke:#F9AB00,stroke-width:2px,color:#202124
  classDef done fill:#E6F4EA,stroke:#188038,stroke-width:2px,color:#202124
  classDef ended fill:#F1F3F4,stroke:#5F6368,stroke-width:2px,color:#202124
  class OPEN open
  class ACCEPTED,IN_PROGRESS,PICKED_UP,DELIVERED active
  class COMPLETED done
  class EXPIRED,CANCELLED ended
